---
description: Healthcare Hub project rules and current handover state
alwaysApply: true
---
Before any change, read `CLAUDE.md` (non-negotiables, document map) and `docs/HANDOVER.md`
(status of the 28-task workflow fix programme and what to do next).

- Packages resolve to `dist`: rebuild with `pnpm --filter @hub/contracts --filter @hub/rules --filter @hub/domain build` after editing them.
- New API routes: zod contract + `@RequirePermission` + audit event + entry in `packages/contracts/src/routes.ts`.
- Web UI: no window.prompt/confirm/alert (use `ActionDialog` from `apps/web/src/components.tsx`); status = words + icon + colour; UK dates via `fmtDate`/`fmtDateTime`; no raw codes.
- Upload never makes anything green; a different person verifies.
- Run eslint per package directory; run vitest per app.
- Do not run browser or UI checks until the owner asks; verify with tests only.
